Package: bayesmcmcbook
Title: Course Code and Book for 'Bayesian Statistics and Markov Chain Monte Carlo'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Donnie", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Dependency declaration for building the Quarto book "Bayesian
    Statistics and Markov Chain Monte Carlo: From Foundations to Advanced
    Computational Inference" and running its test suite. This file is used by
    remotes::install_deps() and by continuous integration; the repository is a
    book project, not an installable package.
